n, others unleash devastating damage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GREAT ON THE GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has been developed primarily for PC, with <strong>full support for mouse and keyboard as well as controllers</strong>. From the very beginning, the <strong>Steam Deck</strong> has also been a key focus - ensuring smooth performance, intuitive controls, and an enjoyable experience on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME CONTENT (Early Access start)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Unique powerful spells to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Types of ores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-Day cycle with boss fight and endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree and progress system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully optimized for <strong>controller</strong> and <strong>STEAM DECK</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/5bafe598f68cc11827483b3b3b158a08.avif?t=1768990755\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByteBeyond"],"dlc":[4324290],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/c780f5533e4f6855e2b29fbef5571077ff7dc78e/header.jpg?t=1768990755","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2025 ByteBeyond. Developed by ByteBeyond. Published by ByteBeyond. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li